{"version":1,"content":"<p>現時娛樂圈面臨着市場寒冬，不少藝人都要放下身段投身其他行業或兼多分職業，最具代表性的算是由歌手轉型為「職安真漢子」的吳浩康(Deep)，之前演員林耀聲（阿聲）亦投身地盤工，原來兩人是賓主關係，阿聲已在Deep的金屬棚架公司任職半年。</p><p>Deep</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.716928+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_hash":"cbcaa6a5229e54f81424e4901e35c7e4ac925e34df2ed187edbeb69144bf2fdb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}